    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >WELCOME, VOLUNTEER</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to Frost-Falls - a city where crimes don\u2019t cool down, even beneath eternal snow.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are private detective Alex Mason, arriving in Frost-Falls to volunteer for the international agency I.O.S.C.P, which investigates digital crimes through the screens of compromised devices.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3793290/extras/98ddf99ff4b06eb1595c7af111b26598.poster.avif?t=1751875625\" width=720 height=404 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3793290/extras/98ddf99ff4b06eb1595c7af111b26598.webm?t=1751875625\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3793290/extras/98ddf99ff4b06eb1595c7af111b26598.mp4?t=1751875625\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >SHADOW OF THE PAST</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every case tells its own story.<br>Every suspect is a shadow from the past.<br>And somewhere in all that digital noise lies the faint trace of Alex\u2019s missing family...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3793290/extras/351fe8268dc0cbaaeefbb2c7ad7da135.poster.avif?t=1751875625\" width=720 height=404 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3793290/extras/351fe8268dc0cbaaeefbb2c7ad7da135.webm?t=1751875625\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3793290/extras/351fe8268dc0cbaaeefbb2c7ad7da135.mp4?t=1751875625\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >KEEPING ORDER</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Examine clues on devices, solve puzzles, reconstruct timelines - and move closer to the truth, and to your own hidden story.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Assist the police in unraveling crimes across the bleak, snow-covered streets of Frost-Falls.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3793290/extras/0d41930e55bb455eeb35f3fac08185be.poster.avif?t=1751875625\" width=720 height=404 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3793290/extras/0d41930e55bb455eeb35f3fac08185be.webm?t=1751875625\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3793290/extras/0d41930e55bb455eeb35f3fac08185be.mp4?t=1751875625\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >THE CLASSICS RETURN</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step back into the golden age of noir detectives and retro visuals -</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The PS1-inspired art style delivers raw nostalgia for late \u201990s gaming.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Low-poly models, muted tones, and the soft hum of a screen build a chilling atmosphere where every pixel feels like a clue.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3793290/extras/ba40b73a772f46ddd997a3dec65363b5.poster.avif?t=1751875625\" width=720 height=404 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3793290/extras/ba40b73a772f46ddd997a3dec65363b5.webm?t=1751875625\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3793290/extras/ba40b73a772f46ddd997a3dec65363b5.mp4?t=1751875625\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >GAME FEATURES</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A noir-inspired <strong>point-and-click detective thriller</strong> with a deep, story-driven experience.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unique screenlife investigation gameplay - solve cases by digging through victims\u2019 and suspects\u2019 digital devices.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Search for clues on the devices of victims and suspects - recover conversations, examine photos, and dig through apps.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Solve puzzles, connect timelines, and piece together the truth behind every case.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Retro visuals in the style of classic PS1-era games - lo-fi textures, muted palettes, screen grain and pixel chill.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore a cold, atmospheric snowbound metropolis built on mystery, memory, and shadows.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Original soundtrack.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Uncover the secrets buried beneath layers of ice and lies! Frost-Falls is a snowbound metropolis where footprints don\u2019t fade...They freeze.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >WELCOME, VOLUNTEER</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to Frost-Falls - a city where crimes don\u2019t cool down, even beneath eternal snow.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are private detective Alex Mason, arriving in Frost-Falls to volunteer for the international agency I.O.S.C.P, which investigates digital crimes through the screens of compromised devices.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3793290/extras/98ddf99ff4b06eb1595c7af111b26598.poster.avif?t=1751875625\" width=720 height=404 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3793290/extras/98ddf99ff4b06eb1595c7af111b26598.webm?t=1751875625\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3793290/extras/98ddf99ff4b06eb1595c7af111b26598.mp4?t=1751875625\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >SHADOW OF THE PAST</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every case tells its own story.<br>Every suspect is a shadow from the past.<br>And somewhere in all that digital noise lies the faint trace of Alex\u2019s missing family...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3793290/extras/351fe8268dc0cbaaeefbb2c7ad7da135.poster.avif?t=1751875625\" width=720 height=404 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3793290/extras/351fe8268dc0cbaaeefbb2c7ad7da135.webm?t=1751875625\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3793290/extras/351fe8268dc0cbaaeefbb2c7ad7da135.mp4?t=1751875625\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >KEEPING ORDER</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Examine clues on devices, solve puzzles, reconstruct timelines - and move closer to the truth, and to your own hidden story.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Assist the police in unraveling crimes across the bleak, snow-covered streets of Frost-Falls.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3793290/extras/0d41930e55bb455eeb35f3fac08185be.poster.avif?t=1751875625\" width=720 height=404 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3793290/extras/0d41930e55bb455eeb35f3fac08185be.webm?t=1751875625\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3793290/extras/0d41930e55bb455eeb35f3fac08185be.mp4?t=1751875625\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >THE CLASSICS RETURN</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step back into the golden age of noir detectives and retro visuals -</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The PS1-inspired art style delivers raw nostalgia for late \u201990s gaming.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Low-poly models, muted tones, and the soft hum of a screen build a chilling atmosphere where every pixel feels like a clue.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3793290/extras/ba40b73a772f46ddd997a3dec65363b5.poster.avif?t=1751875625\" width=720 height=404 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3793290/extras/ba40b73a772f46ddd997a3dec65363b5.webm?t=1751875625\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3793290/extras/ba40b73a772f46ddd997a3dec65363b5.mp4?t=1751875625\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >GAME FEATURES</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A noir-inspired <strong>point-and-click detective thriller</strong> with a deep, story-driven experience.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unique screenlife investigation gameplay - solve cases by digging through victims\u2019 and suspects\u2019 digital devices.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Search for clues on the devices of victims and suspects - recover conversations, examine photos, and dig through apps.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Solve puzzles, connect timelines, and piece together the truth behind every case.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Retro visuals in the style of classic PS1-era games - lo-fi textures, muted palettes, screen grain and pixel chill.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore a cold, atmospheric snowbound metropolis built on mystery, memory, and shadows.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Original soundtrack.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Uncover the secrets buried beneath layers of ice and lies! Frost-Falls is a snowbound metropolis where footprints don\u2019t fade...They freeze.</p>",
    "short_description": "Solve crimes through the screens of digital devices in the bleak, snow-covered city of Frost-Falls. Become a detective in an interactive noir thriller inspired by PS1-era visuals - with retro style, pixelated chill, and a haunting 90s atmosphere.",
